{
    "title": "Fonto - story font for IG",
    "description": "Using the Fonto - Story font for instagram application, you can create beautiful and attractive stories with various fonts and backgrounds.\r\n\r\nThe Fonto app allows you to change the fonts of Instagram stories without special settings.\r\n\r\nOne way to increase Instagram story traffic is to use attractive fonts and backgrounds so that the audience stays on your story for a long time. With the Fonto - Story font for instagram application, you can increase the viewing of your stories by using beautiful backgrounds and fonts.\r\n\r\nThere are many world-famous backgrounds in the Fonto - Story font for instagram application, and by selecting each of them, you can personalize them and make them more beautiful by using material colors.\r\n\r\nIn this application, each background has special settings that allow you to customize the backgrounds as much as you can.\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to use Fonto application:\r\n* The first method of saving in the gallery:\r\nCopy to the clipboard like iPhones! In Fonto application, you can directly copy the font without saving and paste it in the Instagram story with any keyboard you have (Samsung or GBoard). To do this, after designing your text, click on the export button and then select copy to clipboard. After it is saved in your clipboard, go to Instagram story and select paste via keyboard.\r\n\r\nIf for any reason this method does not work for you, use the second method!!!\r\n\r\n* The second method of saving in the gallery:\r\nFirst, type your text with the desired font. Then click exit. Your text is saved as a photo in the phone gallery. Now enter the Instagram story. Choose the photo or video you want. Now click on the sticker button and select the sticker gallery. Now select the font from the photo gallery and comment on the video or photo mode.\r\n\r\nFonto is not just for Instagram! You can use it for WhatsApp statuses and other applications such as Twitter and Facebook.\r\n\r\nFonto - Story font for instagram allows you to change your Instagram font without having to install another application. You can change the font of any text from the Fonts section.\r\n\r\nSome key features of Fonto - Stor font for instagram:\r\n- Simple and beautiful user interface\r\n- Select new and raised backgrounds\r\nAbility to customize each background individually\r\n- Ability to select new and relevant fonts\r\n- Unlimited font selection\r\n- Convenient storage of backgrounds\r\n\r\nChanging the Instagram font in the Fonto - Story font for instagram app is easy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Using the Fonto - Story font for instagram application, you can create beautiful and attractive stories with various fonts and backgrounds.<br><br>The Fonto app allows you to change the fonts of Instagram stories without special settings.<br><br>One way to increase Instagram story traffic is to use attractive fonts and backgrounds so that the audience stays on your story for a long time. With the Fonto - Story font for instagram application, you can increase the viewing of your stories by using beautiful backgrounds and fonts.<br><br>There are many world-famous backgrounds in the Fonto - Story font for instagram application, and by selecting each of them, you can personalize them and make them more beautiful by using material colors.<br><br>In this application, each background has special settings that allow you to customize the backgrounds as much as you can.<br><br><br>How to use Fonto application:<br>* The first method of saving in the gallery:<br>Copy to the clipboard like iPhones! In Fonto application, you can directly copy the font without saving and paste it in the Instagram story with any keyboard you have (Samsung or GBoard). To do this, after designing your text, click on the export button and then select copy to clipboard. After it is saved in your clipboard, go to Instagram story and select paste via keyboard.<br><br>If for any reason this method does not work for you, use the second method!!!<br><br>* The second method of saving in the gallery:<br>First, type your text with the desired font. Then click exit. Your text is saved as a photo in the phone gallery. Now enter the Instagram story. Choose the photo or video you want. Now click on the sticker button and select the sticker gallery. Now select the font from the photo gallery and comment on the video or photo mode.<br><br>Fonto is not just for Instagram! You can use it for WhatsApp statuses and other applications such as Twitter and Facebook.<br><br>Fonto - Story font for instagram allows you to change your Instagram font without having to install another application. You can change the font of any text from the Fonts section.<br><br>Some key features of Fonto - Stor font for instagram:<br>- Simple and beautiful user interface<br>- Select new and raised backgrounds<br>Ability to customize each background individually<br>- Ability to select new and relevant fonts<br>- Unlimited font selection<br>- Convenient storage of backgrounds<br><br>Changing the Instagram font in the Fonto - Story font for instagram app is easy.",
